        {
          "id": 809547966,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Makes sense. Should it be \"Systemd Journal Export Block\" or \"systemd Journal Export Block\"? It seems like systemd is one of those proper names that is never capitalized. https://www.ietf.org/id/draft-richardson-opsawg-pcapng-extras-00.html#name-systemd-journal-export-bloc\n\nIt's not capitalized in the [wtap_encap_description](wiretap/wtap.c#L1148), so presumably not capitalized here. (That latter effects means that if you add all the encaps to a QComboBox in the GUI and sort by name, the systemd encapsulation (along with \"nRF Sniffer for Bluetooth LE\") sorts after everything else. But that's a different issue, would have to be resolved by using a QSortFilterProxyModel with the combobox.)",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
