      ],
      "title": "wiretap: Register a systemd Journal Export Block",
      "message": "wiretap: Register a systemd Journal Export Block\n\nThe block is lightweight and doesn't have any options so the create\nfunction doesn't really do anything, but it needs to be registered\nso that when systemd journal files are opened, the wtap_block_create()\ncall works and doesn't segfault. Fix #17875\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-01-12T23:42:13.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
